### marchez prima livrare
PATCH http://localhost:3000/stops/25
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "delivered", "paid_cash": "50.00", "paid_transfer": "0.00" }

### rerutare de la ora 11:00 (660 min)
POST http://localhost:3000/routes/reroute
Content-Type: application/json

{ "delivery_week": "2026-08-10", "day": "thursday", "current_time_min": 660 }

### verific noua ordine
GET http://localhost:3000/routes/day?week=2026-08-10&day=thursday

### reprogramare
PATCH http://localhost:3000/orders/7/reschedule
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "time_windows": [
    { "day": "thursday", "start_time": "16:00:00", "end_time": "19:00:00" }
  ]
}

